      "props": {
        "text": "Run mode routes only request traffic: feed reads to the timeline cache, post creates to the post store. Fan-out (~1.46M timeline inserts/s at peak) runs from Kafka in the background; workers pull from Kafka, so it is drawn as worker to Kafka. The timeline cluster is sized for those inserts, which is why it looks idle here. Feed API latency (40 ms) includes its parallel calls to ranking and the post cache."
